**Evidence dari screenshot:**
- `ScheduleProposeModal` pakai native `<input type="datetime-local">` — format `mm/dd/yyyy --:-- --`, scroll picker jelek
- User harus isi start + end per slot, sampai 3 slot → 6 datetime input = ribet
- Tidak ada visual preview kalender
- Modal layout polos, tanpa polish

**Root files:**
- [ScheduleProposeModal.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/scheduling/ScheduleProposeModal.tsx) — native datetime input, MAX_SLOTS=3
- [SlotPickerModal.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/scheduling/SlotPickerModal.tsx) — user slot picker (OK tapi plain)

