### Komponen 3: ScheduleProposeModal Redesign (Catatan 1 — P1)

#### [MODIFY] [ScheduleProposeModal.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/scheduling/ScheduleProposeModal.tsx)

**Current UX problems:**
1. Native `<input type="datetime-local">` — ugly, inconsistent cross-browser
2. User harus isi start + end per slot (6 inputs untuk 3 slot)
3. Tidak ada visual calendar context
4. Plain dialog tanpa polish

**Redesign approach (Frontend Design Plugin — Luxury/Refined aesthetic):**

1. **Simplified slot input:**
   - Ganti 2 datetime-input per slot → 1 date picker + duration preset
   - User pilih tanggal → pilih jam mulai dari preset (08:00, 09:00, ..., 16:00)
   - Duration auto 1 jam (bisa adjust)
   - Max 3 slot tetap, tapi UX jauh lebih simpel

2. **Visual design:**
   - Card-based slot selector dengan hover effect
   - Date picker pakai mini calendar inline (bukan native browser picker)
   - Time slots sebagai clickable chips (09:00, 10:00, 11:00...)
   - Selected slot = highlighted card dengan animasi smooth
   - Dark mode full support

3. **Layout redesign:**
   ```
   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │  📅 Jadwalkan Instalasi                  │
   │                                           │
   │  Item:  ☑ PC AIO (qty: 1)               │
   │         ☑ PC Rakitan (qty: 1)            │
   │                                           │
   │  Teknisi: [Dropdown]                      │
   │                                           │
   │  ── Slot 1 ──────────────────────────    │
   │  📅 [21 Apr 2026]  ⏰ [09:00] ~ 1 jam   │
   │                                           │
   │  + Tambah slot alternatif                 │
   │                                           │
   │  Catatan: [________________]              │
   │                                           │
   │         [Batal]  [Usulkan ke User]        │
   └─────────────────────────────────────────┘
   ```

4. **Implementation:**
   - Custom date picker component (pakai `date-fns` yang sudah terinstall)
   - Time chip grid: jam 08-17, interval 30 min
   - Auto calculate `end` = `start + 1h` (editable)
   - Framer Motion: stagger reveal, slot card hover scale
   - Dark mode: semua elemen

#### [MODIFY] [SlotPickerModal.tsx](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/components/scheduling/SlotPickerModal.tsx)

